/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 69 0 R
/T (Managing personal work, study activities, and daily responsibilities becomes difficult when tasks are not recorded in an organized way. A to-do list provides a simple method to keep track of work that needs to be completed. This project implements that idea as a Java console application.)
/E (Managing personal work, study activities, and daily responsibilities becomes difficult when tasks are not recorded in an organized way. A to-do list provides a simple method to keep track of work that needs to be completed. This project implements that idea as a Java console application.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [5]
>>
