/T (The user interacts with the program through a numbered menu. Each selected option calls a method that performs a particular operation. The application uses a linked structure to store task objects and traverses the structure when tasks need to be displayed, searched, or deleted.)
/E (The user interacts with the program through a numbered menu. Each selected option calls a method that performs a particular operation. The application uses a linked structure to store task objects and traverses the structure when tasks need to be displayed, searched, or deleted.)
