/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 69 0 R
/T (organize and manage everyday tasks. The system provides a simple menu-driven interface through which users can add tasks, view all saved tasks during the current session, search tasks by title keyword, mark tasks as completed, and delete tasks using their unique IDs.)
/E (organize and manage everyday tasks. The system provides a simple menu-driven interface through which users can add tasks, view all saved tasks during the current session, search tasks by title keyword, mark tasks as completed, and delete tasks using their unique IDs.)
