/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 69 0 R
/T (The project demonstrates core Java programming concepts, including classes, objects, methods, loops, conditional statements, exception handling, and collections. A custom Singly Linked List is used as the primary task storage structure. An ArrayList is used to collect task records for display and search results. Linear Searching is used to locate tasks by title keyword or task ID.)
/E (The project demonstrates core Java programming concepts, including classes, objects, methods, loops, conditional statements, exception handling, and collections. A custom Singly Linked List is used as the primary task storage structure. An ArrayList is used to collect task records for display and search results. Linear Searching is used to locate tasks by title keyword or task ID.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
