/Title (The custom Singly Linked List provides the main storage mechanism for task records. ArrayList is used to collect tasks for display and search results, while Linear Search is applied to locate matching tasks. Input validation and separate methods help keep the application understandable and reliable for beginner-level use.)
/Dest [22 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 397 0 R
/Prev 598 0 R
/Next 666 0 R
>>
endobj
666 0 obj
